  "changes": [
    "Recovery excludes tombstones only when their terminal time is earlier than a later live output creation. Overlapping terminal/live observations and multiple tombstones return explicit uncertain status with null operationId; no invented newest Saved or mixed-clock sorting.",
    "Every posted non-cleanup page RPC subscribes to the exact operation AbortSignal. Abort settles/rejects that foreground pending entry, clears its phase timer and removes the listener. Disconnect/close/timeout/reply use the same settlement path; late replies cannot revive it.",
    "Owned cancel acknowledgement remains independently bounded by the original shared two-second cleanup grace before binding close. Acknowledged restoration is retained; timeout/failure remains unverified. Late original replies cannot initiate output or mutate a newer operation.",
    "Candidate, element, child and text-rectangle footprint work use shared owned DOM task checkpoints. Canonical 256 batch, 50000 discovery/preparation and 12000 frame traversal limits remain. Owned cancel rejects pending yields; temporary text-layout leases and ranges release in actual finally.",
    "Footprint border geometry is rechecked after yields; mapping and anchor are rechecked before hiding pixels."
  ],
